// Local signing settings. Copy to Signing.xcconfig and fill in your own team.
//
// Signing.xcconfig is gitignored on purpose: an Apple Development Team ID
// identifies the developer who owns it, so it does not belong in a public repo.
//
// Find yours at https://developer.apple.com/account under Membership Details,
// or in Xcode under Settings > Accounts.
//
// Leaving it empty is fine for building to the Simulator. You only need a team
// to run on a physical iPad.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
